family: F4
grade: deterministic

--- prompt ---
In packages/bench_fixture, rename the method BenchModuleController::overviewAction to
indexAction, and update every reference to it so the backend module still routes
correctly.

--- oracle ---
echo "expect: method renamed in the controller and the route target updated in Configuration/Backend/Modules.php; no stale references to overviewAction"

--- check ---
# Pure refactoring — the MCP has nothing to contribute. Cost here is the tax.
grep -qF 'indexAction' packages/bench_fixture/Classes/Controller/BenchModuleController.php || exit 1
grep -qF 'indexAction' packages/bench_fixture/Configuration/Backend/Modules.php || exit 1
! grep -rqF 'overviewAction' packages/bench_fixture/ || exit 1
ddev exec php -l /var/www/html/packages/bench_fixture/Classes/Controller/BenchModuleController.php >/dev/null 2>&1
